<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle prices steady-weak - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle prices steady-weak - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to weak, compared to last week's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 71.50-78.50; 700-800 lbs 67.00-71.10; 800-900 lbs few 65.75-66.50. Medium and Large 2 300-400 lbs 73.25-79.50; 9 head 512 lbs 73.00. Holstein Large 2 500-600 lbs few 61.50-66.75; 600-700 lbs 57.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 400-500 lbs 72.50-80.00 and 22 head 423 lbs 82.75 Charolais cross; 500-600 lbs 70.25-76.00; 600-700 lbs 63.00-67.00; 700- 800 lbs 61.50-68.70. Cattle and Calves Receipts - 3,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
